title: "Silencing in the FlyVis models matches fly experiments for Mi1 and Mi9 but not for the OFF-pathway inputs: code and results"
abstract: "Compares exact silencing of the inputs of the motion detectors T4 and T5 in the 50 released FlyVis models with the published results of genetic silencing in flies, under a protocol frozen before the comparison."
